wholesale_price.description:
Price the dropshipper pays the supplier for this line item, read
verbatim from the upstream order. Supplier-facing pass-through;
present only when the upstream line item carries it.

fulfillment_outbound_price.description:
Outbound fulfillment. For a dropshipper, what you are charged;
for a supplier, what you are paid. `0` for a supplier when
Dropea fulfils the order.
